block='<section class="section" id="mission-evidence"><div class="section-title"><h2>From commissioning to a delivery mission</h2></div><div class="delivery-metrics"><div><strong>20.25 km</strong><span>Total out-and-return GPS travel</span></div><div><strong>10.11 km</strong><span>Maximum displacement from arming</span></div><div><strong>35.67 min</strong><span>Armed mission interval</span></div><div><strong>5 kg</strong><span>Rice payload, project-owner confirmed</span></div></div><p>The story below follows the practical work: understand the build, coach the operator in Arabic, prepare the aircraft and then progress to mission and payload-release setup.</p></section><section class="section" id="remote-field-support">'+delivery_narrative(ROOT,'../../',2)+'</section><section class="section"><h2>Mission analysis and supporting report</h2><p>The public report is readable below. It compares the early commissioning test with the matching long-distance mission and documents release commands, control response, vibration and failsafes. Flight locations and raw logs remain private.</p></section><section class="section"><h2>Other heavy-lift work</h2><div class="links"><a href="../heavy-lift/">DARPA Lift Challenge team support →</a><a href="../drone-rover-docking/">Drone-to-rover system →</a></div></section>'
